auth {
    mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
    token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # EmitSignal API

  Publishers POST messages to named topics; subscribers receive them live over SSE.

  ## Authentication

  Collection-level auth sends `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`. The server accepts
  either a Better Auth session token (web/mobile/CLI) or an `es_`-prefixed API key
  in that header. Requests that are meant to run anonymously set `auth: none`
  explicitly — publishing and reading public topics work without credentials.

  ## Environments

  `local` points at the dev server on :5001. Set `token` and `deviceId` there.
}